From: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/dsi: report raw status during error work

The native Matisse modeset repeatedly queues DSI error work, while the
existing synthesized FIFO state also includes normal FIFO_EMPTY bits.
Report raw error registers under the existing print rate limit to
identify the hardware source. Do not change interrupt masks, status
acknowledgements or recovery behavior during this diagnostic.

Signed-off-by: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_host.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_host.c
index a8c8e89ac..0451c3cf2 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_host.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_host.c
@@ -1607,7 +1607,14 @@ static void dsi_err_worker(struct work_struct *work)
 		container_of(work, struct msm_dsi_host, err_work);
 	u32 status = msm_host->err_work_state;
 
-	pr_err_ratelimited("%s: status=%x\n", __func__, status);
+	pr_err_ratelimited("%s: status=%x fifo=%08x ack=%08x timeout=%08x phy=%08x clk=%08x irq=%08x\n",
+			  __func__, status,
+			  dsi_read(msm_host, REG_DSI_FIFO_STATUS),
+			  dsi_read(msm_host, REG_DSI_ACK_ERR_STATUS),
+			  dsi_read(msm_host, REG_DSI_TIMEOUT_STATUS),
+			  dsi_read(msm_host, REG_DSI_DLN0_PHY_ERR),
+			  dsi_read(msm_host, REG_DSI_CLK_STATUS),
+			  dsi_read(msm_host, REG_DSI_INTR_CTRL));
 	if (status & DSI_ERR_STATE_MDP_FIFO_UNDERFLOW)
 		dsi_sw_reset(msm_host);
 
